    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on some training materials for our ED staff here in Chicago. We've been seeing a lot more agitated patients lately, and I want to put together a guide on verbal de-escalation techniques. Can you give me a few baseline steps for how a nurse should approach someone who is becoming verbally aggressive or combative?",
