      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "First, ensure your personal safety by maintaining a safe distance and being aware of your surroundings. Next, adopt a calm and non-threatening posture while using a low, steady tone of voice to lower tension. Actively listen to the patient's concerns without interrupting them, and validate their feelings to build rapport before attempting to guide the conversation toward a solution.",
